<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post575820261076149005..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Sandy Hook and Pre-emptive Civilian Disarmament </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>8</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8005329743979503690</id><published>2013-03-06T12:42:25.935-07:00</published><updated>2013-03-06T12:42:25.935-07:00</updated><title type='text'>We need to remove the aura of godhood, and return ...</title><content type='html'>We need to remove the aura of godhood, and return them to a state of FEAR. Dor_ner was right in that.&lt;br /&gt;And it will get WORSE as we put it off longer. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/8005329743979503690'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/8005329743979503690'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html?showComment=1362598945935#c8005329743979503690' title=''/><author><name>Jean - steyraug96(at)yahoo.com</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575820261076149005' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575820261076149005' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1958605266"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 6, 2013 at 12:42 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2758104196735991897</id><published>2013-01-16T17:59:46.958-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-16T17:59:46.958-07:00</updated><title type='text'>This is a great piece and I am glad it is being ci...</title><content type='html'>This is a great piece and I am glad it is being circulated. There are a million things needed to protect our children at school and none of them have much to do with guns.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This Newtown tragedy is spinning out of control and the focus needed to address the real issues at hand is not there by any of our Leaders.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;They just to focus on gun control....it is so irresponsible. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/2758104196735991897'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/2758104196735991897'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html?showComment=1358384386958#c2758104196735991897' title=''/><author><name>Laurie Lima</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15217431170988503733</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh4.googleusercontent.com/-DHLxUgQL3zk/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAACSc/qMxD6pSA1_M/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575820261076149005' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575820261076149005' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-29902685"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 16, 2013 at 5:59 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8407405236370160340</id><published>2013-01-05T11:13:19.520-07:00</published><updated>2013-01-05T11:13:19.520-07:00</updated><title type='text'>He was sued on multiple occasions by professional ...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt;He was sued on multiple occasions by professional colleagues, who accused him of malicious harassment and reckless driving that resulted in injuries to several other officers.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Wow -- I&amp;#39;ve never heard of anything like that.  He must have been a real loose cannon.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/8407405236370160340'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/8407405236370160340'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html?showComment=1357409599520#c8407405236370160340' title=''/><author><name>william wright</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575820261076149005' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575820261076149005' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-634369433"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 5, 2013 at 11:13 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4785993747615579235</id><published>2012-12-30T18:41:15.339-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-30T18:41:15.339-07:00</updated><title type='text'>lawlor (small letter intended to befit the small m...</title><content type='html'>lawlor (small letter intended to befit the small man) lived his life out of the back pockets of the very society he murdered/abused members of.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This fine specimen of human trash then sues, in essence, that very same society, as taxpayers would provide the compensation should he win the case against the prosecutor.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is a perverted society that allows such trash as lawlor to do all he has done to that society.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I have no word to describe a society that not only tolerates what lawlor did, but then also adds insult to injury by allowing such trash to sue the very taxpayers he so assiduously attacked and, ultimately, killed. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Such a society as that described will not last long because it is obvious such a society tolerates tyranny and will ultimately be totally enslaved.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/4785993747615579235'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/4785993747615579235'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html?showComment=1356918075339#c4785993747615579235' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575820261076149005' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575820261076149005' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-415533211"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 30, 2012 at 6:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9067490225470702953</id><published>2012-12-30T14:01:09.688-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-30T14:01:09.688-07:00</updated><title type='text'>In the U.S. there are 3 basic legal entities:&#xa;1)Go...</title><content type='html'>In the U.S. there are 3 basic legal entities:&lt;br /&gt;1)Government - Sovereign God&lt;br /&gt;2)Corporation - Demigod&lt;br /&gt;3)Person - Fodder&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What Grigg is proposing is that we level the law to apply equally to all 3.&lt;br /&gt;Christ was the embodiment of that same principle: God and Law made flesh.&lt;br /&gt;Likewise, He commands that we bring &lt;i&gt;our&lt;/i&gt; institutions to heel:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ephesians 6:12&lt;br /&gt;For we wrestle not against flesh and blood, but against principalities,&lt;br /&gt;against powers, against the rulers of the darkness of this world,&lt;br /&gt;against spiritual wickedness in high places.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Executive impunity to commit murder is all of the above.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/9067490225470702953'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/9067490225470702953'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html?showComment=1356901269688#c9067490225470702953' title=''/><author><name>Will Blalock</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/18121019056190783526</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh5.googleusercontent.com/-XBGKRiOjJJQ/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAB4/D30hxKlZizg/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575820261076149005' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575820261076149005' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-832848697"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 30, 2012 at 2:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2033662627610777120</id><published>2012-12-30T12:26:24.092-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-30T12:26:24.092-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;But if sociopaths in uniform are required to...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;But if sociopaths in uniform are required to give up their guns, how would they be able to disarm the rest of us?&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Bingo!  And that Will is the bottom line.  And do you think for one moment that they would willingly give up theirs in any act of leading by example?  Hell no!  And so long as they remain armed the public deserves no less than what they reserve unto themselves.  Otherwise there is a cattle car waiting for us all.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/2033662627610777120'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/2033662627610777120'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html?showComment=1356895584092#c2033662627610777120' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575820261076149005' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575820261076149005' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-610080049"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 30, 2012 at 12:26 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5984628259138915610</id><published>2012-12-30T09:40:23.169-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-30T09:40:23.169-07:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>This comment has been removed by the author.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/5984628259138915610'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/5984628259138915610'/><author><name>Will Blalock</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/18121019056190783526</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh5.googleusercontent.com/-XBGKRiOjJJQ/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAB4/D30hxKlZizg/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575820261076149005' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575820261076149005' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name='blogger.contentRemoved' value='true'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-832848697"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 30, 2012 at 9:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5110999159942695485</id><published>2012-12-30T00:07:28.439-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-30T00:07:28.439-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The fallacy with the kind of thinking in CT is tha...</title><content type='html'>The fallacy with the kind of thinking in CT is that guns are the problem.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Guns have been in the hands of the public since the country was founded, but the mass shootings are a relatively recent phenomena.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;While I am okay with local laws regarding firearm control, it has been posed to me, and I think it makes sense, that a lot of these guns control laws are an attempt to find out WHO has guns, and is the first step in disarming the public.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Of course, our government would never deceive us....would they?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;LC</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/5110999159942695485'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/575820261076149005/comments/default/5110999159942695485'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html?showComment=1356851248439#c5110999159942695485' title=''/><author><name>DiscConnected</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07013919800637508392</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='24' height='32' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_dnBUTaw5i1o/TIf6gCeNOrI/AAAAAAAAAUg/cVor91T5I3Y/S220/todd+AWATS+tee+face.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/sandy-hook-and-pre-emptive-civilian.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-575820261076149005' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/575820261076149005' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-966516942"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 30, 2012 at 12:07 AM"/></entry></feed>